hub.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.11037.4004) - AMD Ryzen Threadripper 7970X 32-Cores (64 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen starting with an empty `.godot` folder, running `--headless --import --quit` throws errors when attempting to load a custom font or theme with a custom resource:\n```\nERROR: Cannot open file 'res://.godot/imported/luckiest_guy_regular.ttf-c8438e1e9c12ecf01834e59d3a7b7b4d.fontdata'.\n   at: (core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp:1225)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://.godot/imported/luckiest_guy_regular.ttf-c8438e1e9c12ecf01834e59d3a7b7b4d.fontdata. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n   at: (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:335)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://luckiest_guy_regular.ttf. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n   at: (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:335)\nERROR: Error loading custom project font 'uid://cmi7sga7vqvru'\n   at: initialize_theme (scene/theme/theme_db.cpp:82)\n```\nI imagine this shouldn't happen, since the goal of the `--import` flag should be to ensure all assets are imported before they are used.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new project\n- Add a custom font\n- Set custom font in project settings\n- Close project\n- Delete .godot folder\n- Run godot.exe --import --headless --quit\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[custom_font_issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19170347/custom_font_issue.zip)\nRun godot.exe --import --headless --quit to see the error","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103930/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}